                          total size of the journal with  ffaasstt__ccoommmmiitt  feature
                          set  is  _j_o_u_r_n_a_l_-_s_i_z_e  +  ( _f_a_s_t_-_c_o_m_m_i_t_-_s_i_z_e * 1024)
                          megabytes. The total journal size  may  be  no  more
                          than 10,240,000 file system blocks or half the total
